SUMMARY (plain language)
================================================================================

You MAY use ReZephyr in your apps and products.

You MUST credit the creator and keep the ReZephyr brand identity when you
use, copy, fork, redistribute, or derive from this design system.

You may NOT claim ReZephyr as your own design system, rename it as if you
created it, or strip the creator’s name and brand.

