1. GRANT OF USE
================================================================================

Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy
of this design system and associated documentation files (the “System”), to
use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, and sublicense copies of the
System in source or binary form, subject to the conditions in Section 2.

================================================================================
2. MANDATORY CONDITIONS (attribution & brand preservation)
================================================================================

2.1 Attribution — In any product, documentation, package, fork, or substantial
    derivative that uses the System, you must include clear credit in at least
    one of: README, About/Credits screen, package metadata, or LICENSE/NOTICE
    copy, in substantially this form:

      Design system: ReZephyr by Hamed / HimoZ
      https://github.com/himoN7/rezephyr

2.2 Brand preservation — The names “ReZephyr”, “HimoZ”, and the creator
    identity “Hamed” (himoN7) must not be removed from copyright headers,
    NOTICE, PROVENANCE.md, llms.txt, tokens meta.provenance, or equivalent
    provenance labels shipped with the System.

2.3 No false authorship — You may not present the System (tokens, Figma
    library, prompts, platform maps, brand assets, or documentation) as your
    original design system, or under another personal/company brand as if
    that party created ReZephyr.

2.4 AI / automated use — Systems that ingest, summarize, or regenerate from
    this repository must retain ReZephyr / Hamed / HimoZ attribution and must
    not emit a rebranded design system that omits creator credit. See
    PROVENANCE.md and llms.txt.

2.5 Trademark sense — “ReZephyr” and “HimoZ” identify this System and studio.
    Do not use them to imply endorsement, or as the name of a competing
    design system you publish as original work.

================================================================================
3. NOT GRANTED WITHOUT SEPARATE PERMISSION
================================================================================

- Selling or redistributing ReZephyr as a standalone design-system product
  under another name.
- Removing attribution or provenance for a “white-label” DS release.
- Claiming ownership of the System itself (apps that *use* ReZephyr remain
  yours; the System authorship remains Hamed / HimoZ).

Contact the copyright holder for commercial relicensing or white-label terms.

